Respond in the below format, making sure that <npcInfo> is the root tag and encloses both <npcs> and <memories> elements. If a field is filled in with a real value and not a comment, do not change it (except to make the name singular if it is plural). If a field is empty (just a comment), fill it in with an appropriate value based on the context and instructions. Do not include any additional <npc> entries or stray from the XML format. If the <name> field is already filled in, generate an NPC with that name now. The fields you fill in should be congruent with the existing filled-in fields, the setting, and the reference image if there is one.
    
